      "text": "Q : given a graph of n node and m edges -> undirected unweighted ; each node value \nis also given as 0 or 5\n\nsource node is 1 number node\nyour task is to find for each node \"i\": the shortest path length with maximum +  \nnumber of 5 are maximum  in path ",
